    "chunk_text": "eseon Hie w\u00e6ron welige on \u00feyssum middangearde, & heora wlenca w\u00e6ron swi\u00fee monigfealde on landum & Behealda\u00f0 nu georne eall \u00fe\u00e6t is from heora eagum gewiten. Hie h\u00e6fdon manige glengas deorwyr\u00fera hr\u00e6gla. Eac swylce hie h\u00e6fdon wif & cyfesa, & heora fyrenlustas, & wiste, & plegan, & oforgedrync, & dyslice Ac hwyder gewiton \u00fea welan, & \u00fea glengas, & \u00fea idlan blissa? O\u00fe\u00fee hwyder gewiton \u00fea mycclan weorod \u00fee him ymb ferdon & stodan? & hw\u00e6r syndon \u00fea \u00fee hie heredan, & him olyhtword sprecan? & hw\u00e6r com seo fr\u00e6twodnes heora husa & seo gesomnung \u00feara deorwyr\u00fera gimma, o\u00fe\u00fee \u00fe\u00e6t unm\u00e6te O\u00fe\u00fee hw\u00e6r com heora snyttro & seo or\u00feonce glaunes, & se \u00fee \u00fea gebregdnan domas demde? & seo wlitignes heora r\u00e6sta & setla, o\u00fe\u00fee seo manigfealde licetung heora freonda, & seo myccle Ealle \u00fea syndon nu from heora eagum gewitene, & ofor \u00fe\u00e6t n\u00e6fre efngemyndige hider eft ne cuma\u00fe, ah For\u00f0on, men \u00f0a leofestan, don we so\u00fee hreowe & bote ure synna, \u00fea hwile \u00fee we on \u00feyssum life syn; Ne \u00feearf \u00fe\u00e6s nan mon wenan \u00fe\u00e6t hine o\u00feer mon m\u00e6ge from ecum witum alesan, gif he sylf nele his For\u00feon we sceolon nu beon gemyndige ure saula \u00feearfe, \u00fea h",
